SUMMARY:Part Closure: DISTRICT LINE: Saturday 12 and Sunday 13 September\, 
 no service between Tower Hill / Edgware Road and Ealing Broadway / 
 Kensington (Olympia) / Richmond / Wimbledon. Use MILDMAY LINE services 
 between Gunnersbury and Richmond on Saturday. Replacement buses operate. 
 If travelling to Chelsea vs Hull City AFC at Stamford Bridge on Saturday\,
  please use PICCADILLY LINE services at Earls Court.
END:VEVENT
